think Standfast: every living REDS row (80, 81, 82, 83, 84, 85, 86, 87) reads Closed or Released; only #75 stands as custody-gated errata (a deep-debride history rewrite, Keaton's hand). No agent-closable red booked -- Standfast clear.
think Chose the crux-first next rung deliberately. The cluster-MST tree family had grown fifteen rungs deep into pure graph theory over synthetic pixels; the Lindy-durable move was to reconnect it to geometry rather than enumerate a sixteenth abstract invariant. cluster_subtree_frames is the geometric PAYOFF cluster_mst_subtrees itself teased: cut a seam, and read the two halves a surface draws -- their member sets and their union frames.
think First scene used a hollow corner-L for object A and the star failed to form (is_bridge(1,3) FALSE). Measurement beat memory: the cluster graph uses object_relation's EXACT nearest-pixel Chebyshev distance, not box distance, so a hollow shape's box corner (no pixel) reads far. Redesigned with five solid singleton blocks -- a square whose mutual gaps tie so Prim builds a star on hub L1, plus a far outlier L5 on arm L4 -- and hand-computed the MST and both cuts (python3 absent on the pier, so by hand). GREEN on the first metal run after the redesign.
obs The DECISIVE crux: cutting a bridge PARTITIONS the clusters cleanly (disjoint, complementary, whole), yet the two limbs' union FRAMES need not be disjoint -- the box-is-a-prefilter lesson lifted from one cluster (cluster_facts) to the two halves of a cut. Cut L1-L4: near {1,2,3} frame (1,1)-(6,6), far {4,5} frame (5,5)-(13,13), OVERLAP in the (5,5)-(6,6) corner, frames_overlap TRUE. Cut L4-L5: near frame (1,1)-(6,6), far {5} at (12,12)-(13,13), DISJOINT, FALSE. The member partition invariant, the frame overlap not; areas always sum to the whole (20).
obs Compose not braid (the council-rota read this lap, single-stranded): the rung owns only the limb reads -- the flood that names each side's clusters after a validated bridge, and the union of their frames and areas over cluster_minimum_spanning_tree (build_mst, edges, is_bridge) and cluster_facts (cluster_bbox, cluster_area). A reading over a reading. 198 image modules stand.
obs TAME: split a compound assert(a and b) into two positive asserts (tame_style_check RED then GREEN); width-check exit 0; plain 7-bit ASCII; living-card ASCII GREEN. Witness native contains (REDS #85). Version const from the live clock 034757, no future stamp (REDS #75).
