file tools/cluster_subtree_frames_witness.rish the witness on metal -- build, selftest, five native contains needles, GREEN.
file image/README.md docs-sync -- names the cluster subtree frames after the cluster MST subtrees.
file crux/REMEMBER.md live edge + Git nib repointed single-stranded, cluster_mst_subtrees folded to a prior-nib comment.
recommend keep-going -- the tree family now pays off in geometry; the next crux-first rung is a whole-tree limb-frame decomposition over every bridge at once, an object-count-in-region summary, or a codec read. The Microkernel study rung and a real-photo top-hat still wait on a fetch/license gate. No network, no key, no funds.
